From: DarekM <149845949+aninmucek@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:08:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: google: Add Pixel 8a (akita)

The Pixel 8a (akita) is a zuma (Tensor G3) board like the Pixel 8 Pro
(husky). Add its compatible to the zuma board list.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: DarekM <149845949+aninmucek@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml
index 1f5258ae2..087c6cdbe 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml
@@ -52,6 +52,7 @@ properties:
       - description: Google Tensor G3 (zuma) boards
         items:
           - enum:
+              - google,zuma-akita
               - google,zuma-husky
           - const: google,zuma
       - description: Google Tensor G4 (zumapro) boards
